1
00:00:09,919 --> 00:00:11,119
And you're...?

2
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:12,039
Hello.

3
00:00:12,039 --> 00:00:13,119
I'm from Yijia Real Estate.

4
00:00:13,119 --> 00:00:15,519
I have an appointment today
for the final inspection of the house.

5
00:00:15,759 --> 00:00:16,839
Inspection?

6
00:00:16,839 --> 00:00:18,120
This house was sold?

7
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:18,760
Yes.

8
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:21,039
Ms. Song Cheng gave us
full authority to handle it.

9
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,760
The paperwork's almost done.

10
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:24,120
But she was in a hurry to sell.

11
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,839
The price is below market.

12
00:00:27,839 --> 00:00:29,320
Are you Ms. Yu Song?

13
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:31,199
I am.

14
00:00:31,199 --> 00:00:32,000
Just a second.

15
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:40,039
Ms. Song Cheng specifically said

16
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,200
if a Ms. Yu came looking for her,

17
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,600
I should give this to her.

18
00:00:57,119 --> 00:00:58,200
(Song Cheng.)

19
00:00:58,479 --> 00:00:59,799
(Where on earth are you?)

20
00:01:00,399 --> 00:01:02,000
(What are you trying to do?)

21
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:12,400
(Fire Hydrant)

22
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,120
Jing.

23
00:01:13,120 --> 00:01:13,840
(Song.)

24
00:01:13,840 --> 00:01:16,519
(Song Cheng used a fake identity
to move Song Jing's ashes.)

25
00:01:16,519 --> 00:01:17,719
(What is she up to?)

26
00:01:18,239 --> 00:01:19,000
(Also,)

27
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,239
(I just got word)

28
00:01:20,519 --> 00:01:22,319
(that Song Cheng recently contacted
Song Lin too.)

29
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,480
(Song Lin also...)

30
00:01:24,359 --> 00:01:25,359
(There's no going back.)

31
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:26,719
(Some roads...)

32
00:01:28,439 --> 00:01:29,799
(Once you take the first step,)

33
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:32,359
(there's no turning back.)

34
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,920
(Song Cheng deliberately let me find
the evidence)

35
00:01:34,920 --> 00:01:38,159
(and made me think
she really lost to me.)

36
00:01:39,040 --> 00:01:40,799
(And her real goal is...)

37
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:44,920
Jing.

38
00:01:45,599 --> 00:01:47,319
I know what Song Cheng is up to.

39
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:49,640
She's not trying to hide Song Huaishan.

40
00:01:49,719 --> 00:01:51,640
She's gathering
all the Song children together

41
00:01:51,640 --> 00:01:52,920
to judge Song Huaishan.

42
00:01:53,120 --> 00:01:54,920
We have to find Song Cheng fast!

43
00:01:55,159 --> 00:01:55,719
(Okay.)

44
00:01:55,719 --> 00:01:56,560
(Stay calm.)

45
00:01:56,799 --> 00:01:57,920
(Wait for me. I'll meet up with you.)

46
00:01:58,519 --> 00:01:59,319
Alright.

47
00:02:02,879 --> 00:02:03,680
(Song Cheng.)

48
00:02:03,920 --> 00:02:06,200
=Dear Song=
(Please don't do anything reckless.)

49
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:09,440
=Episode 24=
(The Final Judgment, A New Beginning)

50
00:02:20,520 --> 00:02:21,439
Song Cheng!

51
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:22,479
What are you doing?

52
00:02:26,400 --> 00:02:27,560
Can't you tell?

53
00:02:28,919 --> 00:02:30,319
Bringing the family together.

54
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,159
Dad,

55
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:36,400
today is New Year's Eve.

56
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:38,120
It's a day for family reunions.

57
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,159
Look.

58
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:42,719
Huan. Lin.

59
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:44,919
Jing.

60
00:02:45,599 --> 00:02:47,159
And Song Jing.

61
00:02:48,039 --> 00:02:50,840
Our family hasn't been together
in so long.

62
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:52,840
I'm so happy!

63
00:02:53,039 --> 00:02:54,719
Are you happy, Dad?

64
00:02:56,520 --> 00:02:57,639
You lunatic.

65
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:58,919
You sicko!

66
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:02,520
I should've killed you
along with your mother back then.

67
00:03:04,439 --> 00:03:05,240
Jing.

68
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:08,520
You've been with the Song family
all these years.

69
00:03:08,719 --> 00:03:10,759
Did you always think the Songs

70
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:13,319
were high and mighty,
all polished and glamorous?

71
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:14,840
Today,

72
00:03:15,840 --> 00:03:18,240
I'll let you be an impartial judge.

73
00:03:18,599 --> 00:03:21,759
I'll show you what kind of vile monsters

74
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:24,840
are hiding beneath their skin.

75
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:30,240
Wait, don't do anything rash!

76
00:03:32,319 --> 00:03:33,319
Lin.

77
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,319
You want to live?

78
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:37,599
Yeah.

79
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:39,159
Then tell us,

80
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:43,199
what exactly have you done?

81
00:03:44,919 --> 00:03:47,159
If I tell you, will you let me live?

82
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,840
I... I'll talk. I'll talk.

83
00:03:50,439 --> 00:03:50,919
I...

84
00:03:51,439 --> 00:03:52,280
I...

85
00:03:53,120 --> 00:03:53,919
I... I...

86
00:03:53,919 --> 00:03:57,360
I stole company files
and sold them to competitors.

87
00:03:58,039 --> 00:04:01,000
I embezzled company funds
to buy jewelry.

88
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:01,719
You...

89
00:04:01,719 --> 00:04:03,280
You ungrateful daughter!

90
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,120
Shut up!

91
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:06,199
Lin.

92
00:04:07,039 --> 00:04:07,960
Go on.

93
00:04:09,800 --> 00:04:12,360
I also helped Zhao Hui cover up

94
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:14,000
his harassment of female subordinates.

95
00:04:14,479 --> 00:04:15,840
Song Cheng...

96
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,720
Sis. Sis.

97
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:20,160
I did bully you before.

98
00:04:20,160 --> 00:04:21,360
I'm sorry.

99
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:23,399
But I don't deserve to die, right,

100
00:04:23,399 --> 00:04:24,360
Sis?

101
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:35,680
Huan.

102
00:04:36,639 --> 00:04:37,759
Your turn.

103
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,639
Kill me if you want.

104
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,600
You expect me to grovel

105
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:46,120
like her?

106
00:04:48,920 --> 00:04:49,720
Dream on.

107
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,480
You think I won't?

108
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:53,120
You would.

109
00:04:53,759 --> 00:04:54,720
Of course you would.

110
00:04:55,399 --> 00:04:57,319
You hid the truth about your legs
for that long.

111
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,160
Is there anything you wouldn't do?

112
00:05:02,800 --> 00:05:04,040
You want me to repent?

113
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:06,800
Fine.

114
00:05:07,759 --> 00:05:08,639
I'll tell you.

115
00:05:11,319 --> 00:05:12,319
I regret it.

116
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:18,120
I regret not killing you back then too!

117
00:05:18,120 --> 00:05:18,439
You!

118
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:18,920
Song Cheng!

119
00:05:21,160 --> 00:05:22,120
Don't make another mistake.

120
00:05:22,319 --> 00:05:23,560
It's not too late to turn back now.

121
00:05:24,439 --> 00:05:25,560
Turn back?

122
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:28,240
Jing.

123
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,560
You're too kind.

124
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,319
Do you know

125
00:05:32,639 --> 00:05:34,319
that Song Jing's death

126
00:05:34,319 --> 00:05:36,040
wasn't Song Huan's doing at all?

127
00:05:43,600 --> 00:05:44,720
It was him.

128
00:05:51,839 --> 00:05:52,959
Is that true?

129
00:05:53,399 --> 00:05:54,079
Jing.

130
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,399
Don't believe her.

131
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:58,000
How could I have killed my own son?

132
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:58,480
Oh?

133
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,959
Really?

134
00:06:00,399 --> 00:06:02,519
But when Song Jing was dying,

135
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,519
he named you as the culprit himself.

136
00:06:05,920 --> 00:06:06,720
Impossible.

137
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:08,360
He didn't even have

138
00:06:08,759 --> 00:06:10,399
the strength to speak then.

139
00:06:10,720 --> 00:06:11,920
How could he have recorded anything?

140
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,519
I only said he named you as the culprit.

141
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,720
I never said anything about a recording.

142
00:06:19,519 --> 00:06:20,160
Dad.

143
00:06:21,519 --> 00:06:22,439
How did you know

144
00:06:22,439 --> 00:06:24,600
Song Jing didn't have the strength?

145
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,000
Did you...

146
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,959
watch him die yourself?

147
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:34,759
Song Huaishan!

148
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,319
What actually happened?

149
00:06:36,319 --> 00:06:37,160
Talk!

150
00:06:39,399 --> 00:06:40,199
Yes.

151
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,399
It was me.

152
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:42,800
It was me.

153
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,600
I didn't mean to.

154
00:06:45,839 --> 00:06:46,959
It was an accident.

155
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:48,800
I used too much force.

156
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:49,759
Back then,

157
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:52,600
Song Group was about to
go public overseas.

158
00:06:52,839 --> 00:06:54,600
We couldn't risk any scandal

159
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:55,600
being exposed by reporters.

160
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:57,120
But he insisted on going out.

161
00:06:57,319 --> 00:06:58,600
If he got photographed,

162
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,759
it would hurt Song Group's reputation.

163
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,519
I did it
for the Song family's reputation.

164
00:07:03,160 --> 00:07:05,000
And for you too!

165
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,240
Song Huaishan.

166
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,199
All these years,

167
00:07:13,199 --> 00:07:15,399
I've lived with the guilt
of causing Song Jing's death,

168
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:18,279
taking pills every night just to sleep.

169
00:07:18,480 --> 00:07:19,439
What was all that for?

170
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,600
You deserved it.

171
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:24,120
If you hadn't ruined his face,

172
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:25,800
how could I ever have ended up

173
00:07:26,279 --> 00:07:28,839
killing my own son?

174
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,600
You deserved it.

175
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:33,600
You deserve to live with that guilt.

176
00:07:38,399 --> 00:07:39,199
Fine.

177
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:41,920
Let me tell you a secret too.

178
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:45,240
All those children
your mistresses were carrying?

179
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,519
I was behind every one of their deaths.

180
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:52,759
I couldn't let anyone threaten
my position.

181
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:55,720
Just like you can't let anyone threaten
Song Group!

182
00:07:57,759 --> 00:07:59,120
Like father, like daughter.

183
00:08:00,839 --> 00:08:02,519
You animal!

184
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:05,000
You've left the Song family
without a son!

185
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,720
I'll kill you!

186
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:10,360
I'll kill you!

187
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,399
Song Huaishan!

188
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:15,240
Song Jing wasn't trying to run away.

189
00:08:16,040 --> 00:08:17,560
He snuck out

190
00:08:17,759 --> 00:08:19,600
to buy you a birthday present!

191
00:08:20,319 --> 00:08:21,519
He told me

192
00:08:21,519 --> 00:08:22,920
he wanted to surprise you!

193
00:08:23,199 --> 00:08:24,720
You heartless monster!

194
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:25,759
You're lying!

195
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,240
Jing, stop!

196
00:08:27,839 --> 00:08:29,120
Calm down!

197
00:08:29,959 --> 00:08:32,759
Song Huaishan isn't worth
becoming a murderer over!

198
00:08:36,799 --> 00:08:37,600
Yu Song.

199
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:39,720
What are you doing here?

200
00:08:40,759 --> 00:08:41,559
Perfect timing.

201
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:44,559
Haven't you always wanted revenge?

202
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:45,840
Here.

203
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:47,320
Now's your chance.

204
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:48,840
Kill him yourself.

205
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,440
Song Cheng.

206
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:53,480
Killing isn't

207
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:56,120
the only way to get revenge.

208
00:08:56,639 --> 00:08:58,120
I've already gathered all the evidence

209
00:08:58,120 --> 00:09:00,120
of Song Huaishan's crimes
over the years.

210
00:09:00,559 --> 00:09:02,440
He's not worth ruining our lives over.

211
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:04,159
Alright?

212
00:09:19,919 --> 00:09:20,720
Yu Song.

213
00:09:21,519 --> 00:09:22,320
Yu Song.

214
00:09:24,919 --> 00:09:26,000
I told you

215
00:09:26,639 --> 00:09:28,399
I wouldn't let you get hurt again.

216
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:34,159
♪In whose heart are the lies spreading?♪

217
00:09:34,159 --> 00:09:36,279
(I won't let you get hurt again.)

218
00:09:36,760 --> 00:09:38,559
♪Half is a promise♪

219
00:09:38,559 --> 00:09:39,440
(Ms. Chen.)

220
00:09:39,440 --> 00:09:40,519
♪Half rotting away♪

221
00:09:40,519 --> 00:09:43,120
(You and I are nothing
in the Song family.)

222
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:45,080
(House Rule number five says)

223
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:46,759
(no disrespect or talking back.)

224
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,600
(You might have forgotten.)

225
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:49,720
(Thought I'd remind you.)

226
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:52,919
(Know your place!)

227
00:09:54,480 --> 00:09:56,800
♪She stole the moonlight♪

228
00:09:56,920 --> 00:09:59,280
♪Took away the daydreams♪

229
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:00,720
♪Filled every blank space♪

230
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:03,720
(Tonight, you're the brightest star.)

231
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,720
♪No more getting hurt♪

232
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:09,160
♪No more hiding away♪

233
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,120
♪Shed the old clothes♪

234
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:12,039
(Ms. Song Cheng.)

235
00:10:12,759 --> 00:10:14,600
(It was incredibly dangerous today.)

236
00:10:16,039 --> 00:10:17,639
(Please don't do that again.)

237
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:21,640
♪Half longing♪

238
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:24,240
♪Half resentment♪

239
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:28,960
♪Love spreads through the eyes♪

240
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:30,159
Yu Song!

241
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:32,919
Yu Song, hang in there!

242
00:10:34,360 --> 00:10:39,040
♪In whose heart are the lies spreading?♪

243
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:41,480
♪Half is a promise♪

244
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,920
♪Half rotting away♪

245
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:45,738
♪If love always hides something♪

246
00:10:45,739 --> 00:10:47,400
(Song Huaishan
and the others were brought to justice.)

247
00:10:48,279 --> 00:10:49,039
(A Few Years Later)
(Later on,)

248
00:10:49,039 --> 00:10:50,879
(I went back to the fishing village
from my childhood.)

249
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:53,759
(This place holds precious memories
I shared with my dad.)

250
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:57,080
(Jing took Song Jing's ashes
around the world.)

251
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:58,240
(I know)

252
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,440
(he's making up for)

253
00:10:59,440 --> 00:11:01,080
(their broken childhoods.)

254
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,759
(After Song Cheng got out of prison,
there was no word of her.)

255
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,679
(I looked everywhere,)

256
00:11:05,679 --> 00:11:07,200
(but I have no idea where she is.)

257
00:11:07,320 --> 00:11:09,399
(I live with these memories.)

258
00:11:09,759 --> 00:11:11,720
(My days are full and hopeful.)

259
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:13,840
(Every now and then, a few words
from an old friend)

260
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:16,039
(can keep me happy for a long time.)

261
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,000
(Song,)

262
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:17,840
(all these years,)

263
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,720
(I've taken Song Jing's ashes)

264
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,720
(to so many places.)

265
00:11:21,440 --> 00:11:23,279
(He was locked in that tiny room)

266
00:11:23,279 --> 00:11:24,039
(for years.)

267
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,360
(He can finally)

268
00:11:25,399 --> 00:11:27,159
(go see the outside world.)

269
00:11:27,360 --> 00:11:28,919
(Strange as it sounds,)

270
00:11:28,919 --> 00:11:29,840
(the farther I go,)

271
00:11:29,879 --> 00:11:30,840
(the more I feel that everything)

272
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:32,320
(that once kept us trapped,)

273
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:33,639
(the high walls of the Song family,)

274
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,320
(the gray skies of Nigang,)

275
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:36,919
(and those countless)

276
00:11:36,919 --> 00:11:37,879
(grudges and tangled ties,)

277
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:39,399
(is slowly growing smaller,)

278
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:40,879
(small enough)

279
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,000
(to gently tuck away)

280
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,279
(deep inside my backpack,)

281
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:44,639
(so I can keep moving forward.)

282
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:45,799
(Song,)

283
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:47,360
(the sea is so vast.)

284
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:49,320
(There's a long road ahead.)

285
00:11:49,960 --> 00:11:51,080
(It's time for you to go find)

286
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:52,879
(your own sea.)

287
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:53,919
Yu Song!

288
00:12:12,799 --> 00:12:14,440
Is this your hometown?

289
00:12:14,799 --> 00:12:16,000
I took three boat rides

290
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:17,600
and asked so many people
before I finally found this place.

291
00:12:19,039 --> 00:12:19,840
Cheng.

292
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:25,240
For you.

293
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:26,120
A new gift.

294
00:12:31,159 --> 00:12:32,240
The flame tree

295
00:12:32,679 --> 00:12:34,000
symbolizes a new beginning.

296
00:12:34,559 --> 00:12:35,840
The past

297
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:38,000
was full of bloodshed and hatred.

298
00:12:38,639 --> 00:12:39,440
Yu Song,

299
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:41,639
now we can finally

300
00:12:41,639 --> 00:12:43,120
introduce ourselves properly.

301
00:12:49,759 --> 00:12:51,600
Let's embrace a new beginning together.

302
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:34,960
♪Our eyes met amid the chaos♪

303
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:40,280
♪All my thoughts freeze in place♪

304
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:45,280
♪My aching nerves start to twitch♪

305
00:13:45,480 --> 00:13:49,960
♪Will love break when it ends?♪

306
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:55,000
♪Who leaves whom behind in the past?♪

307
00:13:55,440 --> 00:14:00,120
♪Who will play the heartless one?♪

308
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:05,080
♪The one who leaves
isn't the one to pity♪

309
00:14:05,360 --> 00:14:10,160
♪The one left behind
sews their tears inside♪

310
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:13,880
♪Love and hate share a seam♪
